// Deterministic Query Cycle Detection (Tarjan SCC & Active-Stack), Canonical
// `SemanticKey` Cycle Rotation, Recovery Fallback Values, Cascading-Error Suppression,
// Snapshot-Bound Diagnostic Accumulation/Replay, and Revision Invalidation (T754 / E18.1).
// Implements SPEC-21 §3-§5 (AXS-QRY-020..023, AXS-QRY-030..033, AXS-QRY-050..053, INV-QRY-002).
